{"ticker":"ZBRA","updated":"2026-10-30T23:24:31Z","profile":{"longName":"Zebra Technologies Corporation","shortName":"Zebra Technologies Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","country":"United States","website":"https://www.zebra.com","fullTimeEmployees":10700,"marketCap":17091449856,"trailingPE":33.112743,"forwardPE":16.205153,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9231143,"pegRatio":0.61,"targetMeanPrice":414.85266,"targetHighPrice":460.0,"targetLowPrice":350.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.204,"earningsGrowth":1.215,"grossMargins":0.49581,"operatingMargins":0.21259001,"profitMargins":0.092180006,"totalRevenue":5847000064,"beta":1.584,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":392.78,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":199.05,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Zebra Technologies Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates in the automatic identification and data capture solutions industry worldwide. It operates in two segments, Connected Frontline, and Asset Visibility and Automation. The company designs, manufactures, and sells printers that produce labels, wristbands, tickets, receipts, and plastic cards; dye-sublimination thermal card printers that produce images, which are used for personal identification, access control, and financial transactions; radio frequency identification device (RFID) printers that encode data into passive RFID transponders; accessories and options for printers, including carrying cases, vehicle mounts, and battery chargers; stock and customized thermal labels, receipts, ribbons, plastic cards, and RFID tags for printers; and electronic sensors and temperature-monitoring labels. It also provides various maintenance, technical support, repair, and managed and professional services; fixed readers, RFID enabled mobile computers, and RFID sleds; tags, sensors, exciters, middleware software, and application software; and physical inventory management solutions; rugged and enterprise-grade mobile computing products and accessories, as well as real-time location systems and services. In addition, the company offers barcode scanners and imagers, RFID readers, industrial machine vision cameras, and fixe","summary_zh":"Zebra Technologies Corporation 及其子公司在全球範圍內從事自動識別和資料擷取解決方案產業。它分為兩個部分：Connected Frontline 和 Asset Visibility and Automation。該公司設計、製造和銷售用於生產標籤、腕帶、門票、收據和塑膠卡的印表機；產生圖像的熱昇華熱敏證卡印表機，用於個人識別、存取控制和金融交易；將資料編碼到無源 RFID 應答器中的射頻識別設備 (RFID) 印表機；印表機配件和選件，包括手提箱、車載卡片和電池充電器和卡載塑膠支架；標籤；以及電子感測器和溫度監測標籤。它還提供各種維護、技術支援、維修以及託管和專業服務；固定閱讀器、支援 RFID 的行動數據終端和 RFID 雪橇；標籤、感測器、激勵器、中間件軟體和應用軟體；和實體庫存管理解決方案；堅固耐用的企業級行動運算產品和配件，以及即時定位系統和服務。此外，該公司還提供條碼掃描器和成像儀、RFID 讀取器、工業機器視覺相機和固定設備","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"通訊設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":310.71,"h":313.18,"l":305.43,"c":307.07,"v":732000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":307.23,"h":308.35,"l":303.55,"c":305.71,"v":350300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":307.0,"h":312.06,"l":305.0,"c":311.25,"v":418400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":315.27,"h":315.35,"l":307.42,"c":313.8,"v":454900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":313.84,"h":318.2,"l":311.28,"c":313.8,"v":603000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":312.57,"h":313.57,"l":309.67,"c":312.17,"v":447500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":311.96,"h":316.22,"l":305.0,"c":306.19,"v":636700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":306.19,"h":316.52,"l":303.48,"c":316.01,"v":407400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":314.25,"h":315.99,"l":311.29,"c":312.65,"v":517000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":314.76,"h":323.93,"l":313.01,"c":320.91,"v":486300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":319.68,"h":322.14,"l":316.96,"c":318.41,"v":495300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":318.39,"h":322.28,"l":312.81,"c":317.32,"v":539100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":321.84,"h":325.24,"l":321.28,"c":322.88,"v":479400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":323.02,"h":323.02,"l":315.57,"c":318.54,"v":630500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":316.47,"h":318.5,"l":315.06,"c":315.41,"v":382600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":317.74,"h":322.8,"l":312.66,"c":314.05,"v":470500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":314.0,"h":315.5,"l":307.08,"c":308.48,"v"