their workflows to achieve their critical business objectives, including improved productivity and operational efficiency, optimized regulatory compliance, and better customer experiences.","zh":"我們是自動識別和數據捕獲（“AIDC”）行業的全球領導者。 AIDC 市場包括行動運算、資料擷取、無線射頻識別設備（「RFID」）、熱敏條碼列印以及其他工作流程自動化產品和服務。事實證明，公司的產品、服務和軟體解決方案（「產品」）可以幫助我們的客戶和最終用戶實現工作流程數位化和自動化，以實現其關鍵業務目標，包括提高生產力和營運效率、優化法規遵循和更好的客戶體驗。"},{"en":"We design, manufacture, and sell a broad range of AIDC offerings, including: mobile computers, barcode scanners and imagers, RFID readers, specialty printers for barcode labeling and personal identification, real-time location systems (\"RTLS\"), related accessories and supplies, such as labels and other consumables, and related software applications. We also provide","zh":"我們設計、製造和銷售廣泛的 AIDC 產品，包括：行動數據終端、條碼掃描器和成像儀、RFID 讀取器、用於條碼標籤和個人識別的專用印表機、即時定位系統 (“RTLS”)、相關配件和耗材，例如標籤和其他消耗品以及相關軟體應用程式。我們也提供"},{"en":"machine vision and self-serve touchscreen solutions; a full range of services, including maintenance, technical support, repair, managed and professional services; as well as cloud-based software subscriptions. End-users of our offerings include those in retail and e-commerce, manufacturing, transportation and logistics, healthcare, hospitality, public sector, and other industries. We operate in 129 facilities with approximately 10,700 employees worldwide. We provide our offerings globally through a direct sales force and an extensive network of over 10,000 channel partners, operating in 179 countries.","zh":"機器視覺和自助觸控螢幕解決方案；全方位的服務，包括維護、技術支援、維修、託管和專業服務；以及基於雲端的軟體訂閱。我們產品的最終用戶包括零售和電子商務、製造、運輸和物流、醫療保健、酒店、公共部門和其他行業。我們在全球擁有 129 家工廠和約 10,700 名員工。我們透過直銷隊伍和覆蓋 179 個國家的 10,000 多個通路合作夥伴組成的廣泛網路在全球範圍內提供產品。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"End-users of our offerings are diversified across a wide variety of industries. We have three customers, who are distributors of the Company's offerings, that individually accounted for more than 10% of our Net sales during the past three years. No other customer accounted for more than 10% of our Net sales during these years. See Note 20, Segment Information & Geographic Data in the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements for further information.","zh":"我们产品的最终用户遍布各个行业。我們有 3 位客戶，他們是公司產品的經銷商，在過去三年中，他們分別占我們淨銷售額的 10% 以上。這些年來，沒有其他客戶占我們淨銷售額的 10% 以上。欲了解更多資訊，請參閱合併財務報表附註中的附註 20「分部資訊與地理資料」。"},{"en":"Sales: We sell our offerings primarily through distributors (two-tier distribution), value added resellers (\"VARs\"), independent software vendors (\"ISVs\"), direct marketers, and OEMs, and our software offerings primarily through our direct sales force. We also sell our offerings directly to a select number of customers through our direct sales force. Distributors purchase our products and sell to VARs, ISVs and others, thereby increasing the distribution of our products globally. VARs, ISVs, OEMs, and systems integrators provide end users with a variety of hardware, accessories, software applications, and services. VARs and ISVs typically customize offerings for specific end-user applications using their industry, systems, and applications expertise. Some OEMs resell Zebra-manufactured offerings under their own brands as part of their own product offerings. Because these sales channels p","zh":"銷售：我們主要透過經銷商（兩級分銷）、加值經銷商（「VAR」）、獨立軟體供應商（「ISV」）、直銷商和 OEM 銷售我們的產品，而我們的軟體產品主要透過我們的直銷團隊銷售。我們也透過我們的直銷隊伍直接向特定數量的客戶銷售我們的產品。經銷商購買我們的產品並將其銷售給加值經銷商、獨立軟體開發商和其他機構，從而增加我們產品的全球分銷。 VAR、ISV、OEM 和系統整合商為最終用戶提供各種硬體、配件、軟體應用程式和服務。 VAR 和 ISV 通常利用其行業、系統和應用程式專業知識為特定最終用戶應用程式自訂產品。一些 OEM 以自己的品牌轉售 Zebra 製造的產品，作為自己產品的一部分。因為這些銷售管道"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive environment. The need for companies to improve productivity and implement their strategies, as well as the secular trends around artificial intelligence, cloud computing, automation, and mobility, are some of the factors that are creating growth opportunities for established and new competitors.","zh":"我们在竞争激烈的环境中运营。公司提高生產力和實施策略的需求，以及圍繞人工智慧、雲端運算、自動化和移動性的長期趨勢，是為老牌和新競爭對手創造成長機會的一些因素。"},{"en":"Key competitive factors include the breadth and quality of offerings, as well as pricing, design, performance, durability, geographic availability, warranty coverage, relationships with customers and channel partners, company reputation, and brand recognition. We believe we compete effectively with respect to these factors.","zh":"主要競爭因素包括產品的廣度和質量，以及定價、設計、性能、耐用性、地理可用性、保固範圍、與客戶和通路合作夥伴的關係、公司聲譽和品牌認知度。我們相信我們在這些因素方面能夠有效競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Connected Frontline","val":2960000000,"zh":"連接前線"},{"name":"Asset Visibility & Automation","val":2436000000,"zh":"Asset Visibility & Automation"}],"total":5396000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Tangible Products","val":4418000000,"zh":"有形產品"},{"name":"Service & Software","val":978000000,"zh":"服務與軟體"}],"total":5396000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2695000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":2643000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other","val":1889000000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1724000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"DE","val":864000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":613000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":364000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":5396000000}},"peers":["PAYC","IDXX","ODFL","ADSK","HUBS"]}}